{{!
    @template block_coursesync/conflicts

    Activities that need a decision, and the choices for each.

    Those this course has no copy of are listed first: an activity that never
    arrived because something else was in its way, then the ones that are here
    already and have diverged.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasconflicts bool - Whether anything needs review.
    * conflicts array - The conflicted activities.
    * actionurl string - Where each decision posts to.
    * sesskey string - Session key for the decision forms.
    * keeplocal string - Action value for keeping the local copy.
    * pullremote string - Action value for taking the remote copy.
    * defer string - Action value for deciding later.

    Each conflict carries: remotecmid, name, modname, reason, haslocal,
    localmodified, lastpulled, and willreplaceforeign - whether taking the
    remote version would delete an activity this block did not create.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasconflicts": true,
        "actionurl": "https://example.com/blocks/coursesync/conflicts.php?id=6",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "keeplocal": "keeplocal",
        "pullremote": "pullremote",
        "defer": "defer",
        "conflicts": [
            {
                "remotecmid": 2,
                "name": "Week 1 reading",
                "modname": "page",
                "reason": "The remote copy changed, and this course's copy was edited too.",
                "haslocal": true,
                "localmodified": "This copy was changed on 19 September 2026",
                "lastpulled": "18 September 2026",
                "willreplaceforeign": false
            }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#hasconflicts}}
    <p>{{#str}}conflicts:intro, block_coursesync{{/str}}</p>
    <div class="block_coursesync-conflicts">
        {{#conflicts}}
            <div class="card mb-3">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h3 class="h5 card-title">
                        {{name}}
                        {{#modname}}<span class="text-muted small">({{modname}})</span>{{/modname}}
                    </h3>
                    <p class="card-text mb-1">{{reason}}</p>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted mb-3">
                        <li>{{#str}}conflicts:lastpulled, block_coursesync{{/str}} {{lastpulled}}</li>
                        {{#localmodified}}<li>{{localmodified}}</li>{{/localmodified}}
                    </ul>
                    <form method="post" action="{{actionurl}}" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="remotecmid" value="{{remotecmid}}">
                        <button type="submit" name="action" value="{{keeplocal}}" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm mr-2">
                            {{#str}}conflicts:keeplocal, block_coursesync{{/str}}
                        </button>
                        <button type="submit" name="action" value="{{pullremote}}" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm mr-2">
                            {{#str}}conflicts:pullremote, block_coursesync{{/str}}
                        </button>
                        <button type="submit" name="action" value="{{defer}}" class="btn btn-link btn-sm">
                            {{#str}}conflicts:defer, block_coursesync{{/str}}
                        </button>
                    </form>
                    {{#willreplaceforeign}}
                        <p class="small text-muted mt-2 mb-0">{{#str}}conflicts:willreplace, block_coursesync{{/str}}</p>
                    {{/willreplaceforeign}}
                </div>
            </div>
        {{/conflicts}}
    </div>
{{/hasconflicts}}
{{^hasconflicts}}
    <p class="text-muted">{{#str}}conflicts:none, block_coursesync{{/str}}</p>
{{/hasconflicts}}
